#   A^{phi,TT}_{8->2048} (aggr.) = 1.004 +/- 0.033
# Polarization-only PP detection: 5sigma (homogeneous) / 9sigma (inhomogeneous).
# Total MV detection: 40sigma.
#
# precision_flag = "high" for all rows --- values taken verbatim from Table 1
# without rounding (fid_A_hat values; fiducial bandpowers reproduced from the
# adjacent table column; observed bandpower computed as the simple product).

